# Sulphur Vent's vent pool A with a suit (CIPlay sulphur_vent_acidsuit; in a test world 'CI ...'). The suit box svsuits
# (18.5 0, between the two pool paths on the east flats, since 11-18 w16I) gives 180 s of suit; straight through pool A
# (sv_poolA, 26 10) unhurt.
island Sulphur Vent keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

empty
at 20 2 h=7
use svsuits
walk 20 2 to 16.5 10 to 26 10
wait 6
expect unhurt
walk 26 10 to 35.5 10
open Diggers' crate
wait 2
expect item Scrap 3
